vkeyboard
---------
Virtual keyboard for Roundcube login fields (keylogger mitigation).

Skins
-----
- skins/elastic/  — Elastic and skins that extend it (rc_lite, …)
- skins/larry/    — legacy Larry
- skins/classic/  — legacy Classic

Skin resolution uses Roundcube `local_skin_path()` with fallback
elastic → larry → classic.

Enable
------
Add to config/config.inc.php:

  $config['plugins'][] = 'vkeyboard';

Copy the plugin folder to Roundcube `plugins/vkeyboard/`
(sibling of `public_html/`, not inside the docroot).

Assets are served via `static.php/plugins/vkeyboard/…`.
Do not put `?query` on `include_stylesheet()` paths — RC 1.7
checks `is_file()` and silently skips the sheet.

Version
-------
1.9.3 — RC 1.7 public_html/static.php asset paths; flat Elastic keyboard
